  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow nails one of your pectoral muscles to your ribcage. Because your impressive pecs are a vital part of your shoulder musculature you’ll find it both painful and difficult to perform those heroic mighty swings needed to vanquish your foes.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Roll randomly for side, left or right. Until the arrow is Extracted you’ll suffer a penalty of -2 to your Strength Bonus and -20 to all other physically demanding Tests using that arm.</p><p>Extraction will be <strong>Challenging (+0)</strong>. If performed during an ongoing combat encounter it’ll require two hands and a full Action.</p>"
    },
